msgid "System Updates"
msgstr "Stelselbywerkings"

msgid "Fluff Linux Update"
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update"

msgid "Keep Fluff Linux secure and up to date by installing system updates."
msgstr "Hou Fluff Linux veilig en op datum deur stelselbywerkings te installeer."

msgid "System last updated: %1 (%2)"
msgstr "Stelsel laas bygewerk: %1 (%2)"

msgid "Check for Updates"
msgstr "Soek bywerkings"

msgid "Install Updates"
msgstr "Installeer bywerkings"

msgid "View Updates"
msgstr "Bekyk bywerkings"

msgid "Change view"
msgstr "Verander aansig"

msgid "Updates to Install"
msgstr "Bywerkings om te installeer"

msgid "Package details are unavailable."
msgstr "Pakketbesonderhede is nie beskikbaar nie."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update is still under development. If you encounter an issue, please report it on our GitHub page."
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update is nog in ontwikkeling. Indien jy 'n probleem ondervind, rapporteer dit asseblief op ons GitHub-bladsy."

msgid "System updates were installed successfully."
msgstr "Stelselbywerkings is suksesvol geïnstalleer."

msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

msgid "No network connection!"
msgstr "Geen netwerkverbinding nie!"

msgid "Network connection is limited. If you are not connected to an organizational network, please check your internet connection."
msgstr "Die netwerkverbinding is beperk. Indien jy nie aan 'n organisasie se netwerk gekoppel is nie, gaan jou internetverbinding na."

msgid "pacman process is already running."
msgstr "'n pacman-proses loop reeds."

msgid "The update process could not be started."
msgstr "Die bywerkingsproses kon nie begin word nie."

msgid "The update process could not be cancelled."
msgstr "Die bywerkingsproses kon nie gekanselleer word nie."

msgid "Connection failed while downloading updates. Check your network and try again."
msgstr "Die verbinding het tydens die aflaai van bywerkings misluk. Gaan jou netwerk na en probeer weer."

msgid "The system update failed."
msgstr "Die stelselbywerking het misluk."

msgid "Downloading updates…"
msgstr "Laai bywerkings af…"

msgid "Installing updates…"
msgstr "Installeer bywerkings…"

msgid "%1 / %2 downloaded"
msgstr "%1 / %2 afgelaai"

msgid "%1/%2 updates installed"
msgstr "%1/%2 bywerkings geïnstalleer"

msgid "Updates are currently being installed. Please avoid powering off or restarting the computer until installation is complete. Interrupting the update may damage system files."
msgstr "Bywerkings word tans geïnstalleer. Moet asseblief nie die rekenaar afskakel of herbegin voordat die installasie voltooi is nie. Onderbreking van die bywerking kan stelsellêers beskadig."

msgid "The battery is low. Please connect your computer to a charger while installing updates."
msgstr "Die battery is pap. Koppel asseblief jou rekenaar aan 'n laaier terwyl bywerkings geïnstalleer word."

msgid "Update process was cancelled"
msgstr "Die bywerkingsproses is gekanselleer"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Kanselleer"

msgid "Checking for updates…"
msgstr "Soek tans bywerkings…"

msgid "System updates are available"
msgstr "Stelselbywerkings is beskikbaar"

msgid "Download size: %1"
msgstr "Aflaaigrootte: %1"

msgid "Storage required for system updates: %1"
msgstr "Bergingsruimte benodig vir stelselbywerkings: %1"

msgid "Storage freed after update: %1"
msgstr "Bergingsruimte vrygestel ná bywerking: %1"

msgid "No additional download required"
msgstr "Geen verdere aflaai nodig nie"

msgid "The update checker could not be started. Make sure pacman-contrib is installed."
msgstr "Die bywerkingskontroleerder kon nie begin word nie. Maak seker dat pacman-contrib geïnstalleer is."

msgid "The update check stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Die soektog na bywerkings het onverwags gestop."

msgid "An unknown error has occurred. Please report this issue on our GitHub page for assistance."
msgstr "'n Onbekende fout het voorgekom. Rapporteer hierdie probleem asseblief op ons GitHub-bladsy vir hulp."

msgid "No internet connection. Check your network and try again."
msgstr "Geen internetverbinding nie. Gaan jou netwerk na en probeer weer."

msgid "The repository servers could not be reached. Try again later or check your mirror configuration."
msgstr "Die bewaarplekbedieners kon nie bereik word nie. Probeer later weer of gaan jou spieëlbedienerinstellings na."

msgid "Authorization error, please try again."
msgstr "Magtigingsfout, probeer asseblief weer."

msgid "The privileged update check stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Die soektog na bywerkings met verhoogde regte het onverwags gestop."

msgid "The privileged update check could not be started."
msgstr "Die soektog na bywerkings met verhoogde regte kon nie begin word nie."

msgid "System was not previously updated."
msgstr "Die stelsel is nie voorheen bygewerk nie."

msgid "The last update information could not be read."
msgstr "Die inligting oor die laaste bywerking kon nie gelees word nie."

msgid "The last update information is invalid."
msgstr "Die inligting oor die laaste bywerking is ongeldig."

msgid "Updates were not installed on this system"
msgstr "Geen bywerkings is op hierdie stelsel geïnstalleer nie"

msgid "To update the system, check for available updates using the button below."
msgstr "Gebruik die knoppie hieronder om beskikbare bywerkings te soek en die stelsel by te werk."

msgid "Update date available"
msgstr "Bywerkingsdatum beskikbaar"

msgid "Updated recently"
msgstr "Onlangs bygewerk"

msgid "System is up to date"
msgstr "Die stelsel is op datum"

msgid "Last update was installed more than a month ago"
msgstr "Die laaste bywerking is meer as 'n maand gelede geïnstalleer"

msgid "Last update was installed more than three months ago"
msgstr "Die laaste bywerking is meer as drie maande gelede geïnstalleer"

msgid "%1 second ago"
msgid_plural "%1 seconds ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 sekonde gelede"
msgstr[1] "%1 sekondes gelede"

msgid "%1 minute ago"
msgid_plural "%1 minutes ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 minuut gelede"
msgstr[1] "%1 minute gelede"

msgid "%1 hour ago"
msgid_plural "%1 hours ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 uur gelede"
msgstr[1] "%1 uur gelede"

msgid "%1 day ago"
msgid_plural "%1 days ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 dag gelede"
msgstr[1] "%1 dae gelede"

msgid "Action is required"
msgstr "Optrede is nodig"

msgid "Action is required!"
msgstr "Optrede is nodig!"

msgid "Action required"
msgstr "Optrede nodig"

msgid "Fluff Linux Update cannot continue because the upcoming update requires removing “%1”, which is a protected system package. Removing it could prevent Fluff Linux from working correctly. Please report this issue on GitHub for assistance."
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update kan nie voortgaan nie omdat die komende bywerking vereis dat “%1”, 'n beskermde stelselpakket, verwyder word. Die verwydering daarvan kan keer dat Fluff Linux behoorlik werk. Rapporteer hierdie probleem asseblief op GitHub vir hulp."

msgid "To allow the system to install updates, Fluff Linux Update needs to remove “%1”. Removing this package may affect related software. If you are not sure, please report the issue on GitHub for help."
msgstr "Om stelselbywerkings te installeer, moet Fluff Linux Update “%1” verwyder. Die verwydering van hierdie pakket kan verwante sagteware beïnvloed. Indien jy onseker is, rapporteer die probleem asseblief op GitHub vir hulp."

msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Aanvaar"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Sluit"

msgid "To allow system updates to continue, %1 was automatically removed after it was deemed safe to remove."
msgstr "Om stelselbywerkings te laat voortgaan, is %1 outomaties verwyder nadat dit veilig geag is om te verwyder."

msgid "To allow system updates to continue, the following packages were automatically removed after they were deemed safe to remove: %1"
msgstr "Om stelselbywerkings te laat voortgaan, is die volgende pakkette outomaties verwyder nadat dit veilig geag is om te verwyder: %1"

msgid "A file conflict was detected and resolved. %1 was renamed to %2. The update process has restarted."
msgstr "'n Lêerkonflik is opgespoor en opgelos. %1 is na %2 hernoem. Die bywerkingsproses het herbegin."

msgid "The conflicting package could not be removed. Please seek support."
msgstr "Die botsende pakket kon nie verwyder word nie. Vra asseblief ondersteuning."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update could not verify the FluffNet repository signing key. The update was stopped to protect your system."
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update kon nie die FluffNet-bewaarplek se ondertekeningsleutel verifieer nie. Die bywerking is gestop om jou stelsel te beskerm."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update could not verify the FluffNet repository signing key. The update was stopped to protect your system. This may indicate a network problem, an unavailable FluffNet server, an expired or rotated signing key, a repository configuration problem, an unexpected key, or a possible repository compromise. Do not manually accept an unexpected key unless Fluff Linux publishes verified instructions."
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update kon nie die FluffNet-bewaarplek se ondertekeningsleutel verifieer nie. Die bywerking is gestop om jou stelsel te beskerm. Dit kan dui op 'n netwerkprobleem, 'n onbeskikbare FluffNet-bediener, 'n vervalde of vervangde ondertekeningsleutel, verkeerde bewaarplekinstellings, 'n onverwagte sleutel, of 'n moontlike inbraak by die bewaarplek. Moenie 'n onverwagte sleutel handmatig aanvaar tensy Fluff Linux geverifieerde instruksies publiseer nie."

msgid "Repository: %1"
msgstr "Bewaarplek: %1"

msgid "The official FluffNet repository signing key was verified and added to Pacman."
msgstr "Die amptelike FluffNet-bewaarplek se ondertekeningsleutel is geverifieer en by Pacman gevoeg."

msgid "Technical details"
msgstr "Tegniese besonderhede"

msgid "Repository signing-key verification technical details"
msgstr "Tegniese besonderhede van bewaarplek-ondertekeningsleutelverifikasie"

msgid "Failure category: %1"
msgstr "Foutkategorie: %1"

msgid "Expected fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Verwagte vingerafdruk: %1"

msgid "Received fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Ontvange vingerafdruk: %1"

msgid "Requested signing-key fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Aangevraagde ondertekeningsleutel se vingerafdruk: %1"

msgid "Pacman exit status: %1"
msgstr "Pacman-afsluitstatus: %1"

msgid "FLU version: %1"
msgstr "FLU-weergawe: %1"

msgid "Fluff Linux version: %1"
msgstr "Fluff Linux-weergawe: %1"

msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "Probeer weer"

msgid "Copy Technical Details"
msgstr "Kopieer tegniese besonderhede"

msgid "Open an Issue on GitHub"
msgstr "Rapporteer 'n probleem op GitHub"

msgid "There is not enough free storage to continue the update. Free up space and try again."
msgstr "Daar is nie genoeg vrye bergingsruimte om die bywerking voort te sit nie. Maak ruimte vry en probeer weer."

msgid "A package or repository signature could not be verified. The update was stopped. Check your system date and keyring, then try again."
msgstr "'n Pakket- of bewaarplekhandtekening kon nie geverifieer word nie. Die bywerking is gestop. Gaan jou stelseldatum en sleutelring na en probeer weer."

msgid "The package database is damaged or unreadable. The update was stopped. Please seek support before repairing the database."
msgstr "Die pakketdatabasis is beskadig of onleesbaar. Die bywerking is gestop. Vra asseblief ondersteuning voordat jy die databasis herstel."

msgid "A downloaded package is damaged or incomplete. The update was stopped. Please try again or use a different mirror."
msgstr "'n Afgelaaide pakket is beskadig of onvolledig. Die bywerking is gestop. Probeer asseblief weer of gebruik 'n ander spieëlbediener."

msgid "The update could not read or write required files. Check filesystem permissions and disk health, then try again."
msgstr "Die bywerking kon nie vereiste lêers lees of skryf nie. Gaan lêerstelseltoestemmings en die skyf se toestand na en probeer weer."

msgid "The updates could not be downloaded. Please try again or seek support."
msgstr "Die bywerkings kon nie afgelaai word nie. Probeer asseblief weer of vra ondersteuning."

msgid "The update transaction could not be prepared. Please try again or seek support."
msgstr "Die bywerkingstransaksie kon nie voorberei word nie. Probeer asseblief weer of vra ondersteuning."

msgid "The update could not start because sleep prevention could not be enabled. Please try again."
msgstr "Die bywerking kon nie begin nie omdat slaapvoorkoming nie geaktiveer kon word nie. Probeer asseblief weer."

msgid "The package database could not be locked. Close other package managers and check that the filesystem is writable, then try again."
msgstr "Die pakketdatabasis kon nie gesluit word nie. Sluit ander pakketbestuurders, maak seker dat die lêerstelsel skryfbaar is en probeer weer."

msgid "Estimated time: %1"
msgstr "Geskatte tyd: %1"
